DECISIONS 203: a field's @go(name:) renames its storage too, so `a: Int @go(name: "B")` next to `b` collides in the getter B and the storage b, reported once, at the getter.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A rule.
record Rule {
  /// One score.
  a: Int @go(name: "B")
  /// The other score.
  b: Int
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8005]  a/a.canon:8:3
  go: B is generated for both a.Rule.a and a.Rule.b

